2026-11-26T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2501) '- A repository's binaries are built offline by its own `flake.nix` and pushed with ORAS to `ghcr.io/v-sekai-fire/<repository>` under a Go pseudo-version (RFD66606-2312); CI pulls them by digest.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2501  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-26T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2501) '- The PC client ships as ORAS folders. A server is a NixOS flake container run by Podman under Eclipse Ankaios, pinned by digest (operator, 2026-11-26).
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2501  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-26T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2501) '- The details hold the targets, the image rules and how flakes compose.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2501  1 LINE
 Text:Written

