2026-11-26T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2501) 'The rulings
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2501  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-26T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2501) '- A repository's binaries are built by the `flake.nix` in that repository, never by another repository's CI or by hand. The targets are Windows x86_64 and Linux x86_64 and aarch64, at single and double precision where the Variant size matters.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2501  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-26T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2501) '- Files, such as libraries, guest ELFs and addons, are pushed with ORAS as plain-file OCI artifacts to `ghcr.io/v-sekai-fire/<repository>`, tagged with the commit's Go pseudo-version (RFD66606-2312). CI pulls them by digest with `oras pull`.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2501  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-26T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2501) '- The PC client ships as folders pushed with ORAS and pulled by digest (operator, 2026-11-26).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2501  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-26T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2501) '- A server piece is a NixOS flake that builds an OCI image with `dockerTools.buildLayeredImage` from nixpkgs, holding only the service and its closure. Podman runs it under Eclipse Ankaios: each server is an Ankaios workload whose manifest pins the image by digest and names its ports and restart policy. CI extracts an image with skopeo and umoci, and Docker Engine is not used. No server piece ships as win64 or runs under NSSM (operator, 2026-11-26).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2501  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-26T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2501) '- The build works offline: the lock file pins every input and no derivation fetches. CI is one job that restores the Nix store from a zstd-compressed cache, builds, and publishes on `main`.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2501  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-26T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2501) '- Flakes compose. Each takes one `nixpkgs` input that a consumer can make `follows` its own, and exposes `packages` and `overlays.default`. Another offline flake takes it as an input.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2501  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-26T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2501) 'Where the tools come from
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2501  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-26T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2501) 'ORAS pushes and pulls plain files as OCI artifacts: https://oras.land/docs/quickstart/ Eclipse Ankaios runs and orchestrates the server workloads, with Podman as its runtime: https://github.com/eclipse-ankaios/ankaios
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2501  1 LINE
 Text:Written
